WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.804
Every YeahVibe app, like
IntentFlow and ShopTools,

00:00:03.804 --> 00:00:07.969
can live on your phone like a real
app, and keep working offline.

00:00:07.969 --> 00:00:11.075
Here's how to set it
up, in under a minute.

00:00:11.675 --> 00:00:16.701
There's no app store and no account. The
app installs straight from your browser,

00:00:16.701 --> 00:00:20.650
and once it's on your phone,
it works even with no signal.

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:25.666
On iPhone, open the app's link
in Safari. It has to be Safari.

00:00:25.666 --> 00:00:29.014
Tap the Share button, the
square with an arrow.

00:00:29.014 --> 00:00:32.925
Scroll down, tap Add to
Home Screen, then tap Add.

00:00:33.525 --> 00:00:38.513
On Android, open the link in Chrome.
Tap the three dots at the top right,

00:00:38.513 --> 00:00:42.134
then tap Install app, or
Install and create shortcut.

00:00:42.134 --> 00:00:45.900
Confirm, and the icon
appears on your home screen.

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:50.619
From now on, open the app from
its icon, not from the browser.

00:00:50.619 --> 00:00:53.475
It opens full screen,
and it works offline.

00:00:53.475 --> 00:00:58.475
Only the very first time, it needs
an internet connection to download.

00:00:59.075 --> 00:01:02.495
The app checks for a new
version each time you open it.

00:01:02.495 --> 00:01:06.950
If something looks out of date,
simply close it and open it again.

00:01:07.550 --> 00:01:10.800
Find all our apps at yeahvibe.com.

